Zotuluka lembani: 1.23, mzere-watsopano.
Zotuluka lembani: (['1.23'] malemba-a-mawu), mzere-watsopano.
Zotuluka lembani: (['1,23'] nambala malemba-a-mawu nambala), mzere-watsopano. # 1,23 no longer valid
Zotuluka lembani: (['1,23'] nambala malemba-a-mawu nambala malemba-a-mawu), mzere-watsopano.
Zotuluka lembani: ['1.23'] nambala, mzere-watsopano.
Zotuluka lembani: ['1.23'] raw number, mzere-watsopano.
Zotuluka lembani: ['1.23'] raw number malemba-a-mawu, mzere-watsopano.
Zotuluka lembani: ['1.23'] raw number malemba-a-mawu nambala, mzere-watsopano.
>> x := (3.5 × 1000000 + 1.5).
Zotuluka lembani: x, mzere-watsopano.
>> x := (3.5 × 100000 + 0.0001 ).
Zotuluka lembani: x, mzere-watsopano.
>> x := (3.5 + 1000).
Zotuluka lembani: x, mzere-watsopano.
x := x malemba-a-mawu.
Zotuluka lembani: x, mzere-watsopano.
>> y := x nambala.
